            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC08-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Good timing, Wizard, this slug was about to tell me how the Admiral intends to free the Chaos Heart... from its indestructible Paradox Chains.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Helena_EM2_85.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413285,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Indestructible save the touch of the Raven-Child... or her Luminiferous Essence. But we had neither, so Spider gave the Admiral a new plan.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Noble_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Vanitus_EM2_46.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413241,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Spider can't break the Chains, but they're moored to places our Cannon CAN destroy. Blow up the Temples of Light, the Heart falls free.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Noble_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Vanitus_EM2_47.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413241,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC08-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "THAT'S the plan? Scare the Vicereine into building this cannon. Then destroy Neumia and its Temple of Light to sever our Chain of Myth and Storm?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Helena_EM2_86.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413285,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You see why I was eager to leave.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Noble_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Vanitus_EM2_48.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413241,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-NIMB-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That is a truly illogical plan, bordering on mental instability. Wizard, we must stop the Admiral at once or everything is lost.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_76.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1413243,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
